{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_5_level_main_05-09_end","groupId":"main_5","stageId":"main_05-09","title":"孽生恶物","storyCode":"5-9","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_05-09_end.txt","sourceHash":"c79a33f85ae436beedbb8c815afcbb290567759c6807375f5f5894fa4fb9b747","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"梅菲斯特眼看已经无路可退，然而随着他的话语，异变陡生！\n形势顷刻间逆转，但是，陈也并非没有后手——","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第六关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rooftop"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"咳......咳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"不堪一击！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"这么多同胞，居然全都被你击溃了？我确实要重新评价一下你的实力，长官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"够了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不够。浮士德，给她点惊喜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"顶楼的，趴下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_5_shot"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"整合运动的狙击手......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"（虽然已经做好了防范措施，但他的火力居然强到这种地步？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"这不能救你的命。在他伤到我之前，你就会死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......等等。你是之前被近卫局抓获的那个感染者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"你们近卫局也让他受了很多苦吧。虽然这和乌萨斯烙在我们身上的相比，根本不算什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"刚才他刻意没有瞄准你，近卫局的长官。这算是我礼节性地回报你，饶你一次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"现在，就连近卫局里也埋藏着不安的种子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"也正是你们的腐坏和大意，让他有机会和我们里应外合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......整合运动，你们对你们所在的这片大地一无所知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"这句话有什么深意吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你认为浮士德是你们整合运动营救的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"近卫局里有许多感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"二十一个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你是不是觉得，至少有四个一定会是彻彻底底的整合运动？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"可是连他们四个也都是我安插的。他们在接应你之后，你是不是囚禁了其中一个？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"很高明，长官。她逃走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"所以现在你还意识不到自己的处境吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，我该意识到的。我的队伍已经溃散，只剩下我任人宰割。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"近卫局内外游荡着缺乏战力的士兵，我的同胞几乎失去了抵抗能力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"你是想这么说吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"还算有些自知之明。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"那么——来，我的护卫们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"起来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_014","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，唔唔，呃呃呃呃呃！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"他们身上的源石......在生长？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"那些源石会刺穿他们原本的身体结构，成为他们新的身躯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"看吧长官，看吧，这就是我的护卫，我不死的护卫。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特的护卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_015","isRemote":false,"text":"【嘶嚎】"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"还有，我的牧群，我的同胞......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_5_7_shining"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"粉尘......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"同胞们需要治疗。他们需要我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"法术？各小队，当心！敌方指挥官释放了法术，粉尘飘散的范围非常大！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"放心，长官，你们不是我的同胞，这和你没有关系。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_014","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊，啊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"正口运动成贝","speakerId":"avg_npc_014","isRemote":false,"text":"......呃，呃！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皜剜祈撠？？斤斤？伐","speakerId":"avg_npc_014","isRemote":false,"text":"呃呃，呃呃呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_014","isRemote":false,"text":"呃呃啊啊啊啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"每非其寺巢巢郡","speakerId":"avg_npc_014","isRemote":false,"text":"......血！！血！！啊啊啊！！！啊！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"安静。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅非斯寺的群群","speakerId":"avg_npc_014","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"陈sir，不好了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"被击倒的整合运动粘上粉尘后，身体产生了巨大的变化，身体产生了巨大的变化！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"他们重新加入了战斗，正在缓缓逼近阵线！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"究竟有多少整合运动产生了变化？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"全部！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"他们是我的牧群，也是我的手足。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"g7，g6。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特的牧群","speakerId":"avg_npc_014","isRemote":false,"text":"——呃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"他们不会倒下，因为我会治愈他们所有的伤痛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你像操作自己的手指一样操作他们，他们只是你的傀儡，怎么能叫做手足？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"在我看来两者并无区别。为了理想，我们什么都可以是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你把这叫做理想的话。看来，我必须要解决掉的就只有你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"有目标，有干劲。很有魅力，长官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"火力集中！快！目标敌方指挥官！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特的护卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_015","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特的护卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_015","isRemote":false,"text":"（呻吟）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"但我的护卫不是常人能撼动的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"用肉体为指挥官挡住了爆炸......还毫发无损？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"刚才的火力，差不多能炸穿一层城市防壁了啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"别白费力气了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"伤口会愈合，皮肉会硬化，生命会复归。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"这些人的武器根本没法对抗我的护卫，毕竟他们只是我为长官你一个人准备的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"同胞们，起身。别让任何人干扰我和长官之间的谈话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"陈sir，整合运动正一波又一波地向我们涌来！常规手段没法击溃他们！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"可恶，难道他们感觉不到痛苦吗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"其他小队也遭遇了相同的状况！徘徊在大楼外的整合运动也开始行动了，他们正冲向大楼，不断地撞击我们刚刚控制住的安保设施！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"优先处理你们身边的敌人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"给我滚开！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"陈sir，这些东西根本就没有知觉，近卫局大楼也被彻底包围了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"我们被迫进入了肉搏战，没法支援你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"照顾好你们自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"明白！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"很壮观吧？他们历经了太多战斗，意识似乎有些不堪重负了，但他们的肉体依然健康强壮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"实力似乎能稍稍弥补一点决策上的失误。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"至少这样我们就有时间慢慢解决我们之间的问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"我想好好和你谈谈，长官，无关这场战斗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"没必要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我会直接解决你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"很快！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"但还不够。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"用剑锋偏移了弩弹？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特的护卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_015","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"预判得很准，黑发小子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁，先用狙击阻挠我的行动，适时预测我的行动，然后填上肉盾？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，长官。我大致能估算到你基本上所有的路线，下一步不过是稍加封锁就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"这样一来，你是没法靠近我的。至于尖锐的弩箭、易爆的弩弹、沉重的弩刺，你喜欢哪种？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"也许你准备得确实很周全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，一个棋手规划完了整个棋局，他就只能将对方当做异色的棋子而非奇兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"（等等，粉尘怎么会粘在她身上......？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"（原来是这样，是这样呀。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我不会像你那样纸上谈兵，我只是有备而来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"棋盘不适用于我，小子。我不是谁的棋子，我是龙门的利刃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"勇敢和莽撞虽然接近，却依然留有一线之隔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"或者，你是想使用自己的底牌了？我似乎还没见你在战斗里使用另一把剑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"那不是把装饰品，对吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"这把剑根本不是用来对付你这种人的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"无论如何，你们都不值得我拔出这把剑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，你们确实该付出代价了，为了你们对龙门、对切尔诺伯格所有无辜者所做的一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"此时，此刻。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"它是你的了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不需要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就当成我暂时借给你的吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你不害怕？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"害怕你会对我兵刃相向？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不，我不怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"为什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"因为我没那么怕死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这不是把庸常武器，你会慢慢理解它的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"平日里勿要挥霍它的煞气。斩龙之剑当有出鞘的价值。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"该向谁出剑，就由你自己选择。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"（......竟然还在蛰伏。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"（即使是这种时候也依然不肯出鞘吗。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"（但现在，赤霄，你必须饮血！）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["陈"]},{"speakerId":"char_015_lmg","aliases":["近卫局成员"]},{"speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","aliases":["梅菲斯特"]},{"speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","aliases":["浮士德"]}]}
